==Battleground==
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 33.33~50 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,500f</sup>.
*7 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~53.33 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,600f</sup>.
*5 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 18 seconds<sup>540f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Le'boin can be quite annoying in this stage as he's quite buffed and can wipe out your units with his good range, but not to worry. Meatshield well, bring along [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Reds]] and your ranged attackers, and all should be fine. If you have [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] then this stage is a breeze.

==Trivia==
*This stage's name references [[wikipedia:Egg-and-spoon race|Egg-and-spoon racing]], a challenge where competitors must carry an egg in a spoon across a long stretch. This event is popular in many school [[wikipedia:Sports Day|Sports Days]].

